# Vercel KV Configuration
# 
# To use Vercel KV, you need to:
# 1. Create a Vercel account and project
# 2. Add a KV database from the Vercel dashboard
# 3. Copy the connection environment variables from your Vercel project
# 
# For local development, these variables will be automatically provided by `vercel env pull`
# Or you can manually set them here in .env.local
#
# Example variables (replace with your actual values):
# KV_URL=redis://...
# KV_REST_API_URL=https://...
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=...
# KV_REST_API_READ_ONLY_TOKEN=...

# During local development without KV, the app will use default in-memory data
